<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 billion mark zero-coupon Eurobond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 billion mark zero-coupon Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    17.FEB.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  28.75     PAY DATE    17.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    28.75     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
